WEBVTT


00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.649
My god,
brother what have you done?


00:01:45.811 --> 00:01:50.607
Yet again we arrived
to witness this monster's aftermath


00:01:52.692 --> 00:01:57.281
I will not tolerate this
any longer Markus


00:01:57.384 --> 00:01:59.053
Your brother must be stopped!


00:01:59.678 --> 00:02:03.327
- It ends tonight
- We must move quickly before they turn


00:02:06.977 --> 00:02:11.565
- Is he still here?
- Yes...


00:02:11.877 --> 00:02:13.858
Viktor...
He must not be harmed


00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:16.674
I gave you my word
did I not?


00:02:16.778 --> 00:02:20.844
But William must be controlled


00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:26.266
Burn the bodies!
Search the outbuilding!


00:02:28.873 --> 00:02:33.565
Markus!
Stay with me


00:03:13.082 --> 00:03:14.959
Give me the torch


00:03:20.798 --> 00:03:22.883
They're changing!


00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:02.353
Retreat to the woods!


00:05:02.458 --> 00:05:04.022
I will stay and fight!
You need my help!


00:05:04.023 --> 00:05:05.794
I need you alive


00:05:05.898 --> 00:05:09.443
If you die, we all die
Now go!


00:05:35.197 --> 00:05:36.866
- We found him
- ..and?


00:05:36.866 --> 00:05:40.932
- We need more men
- Find Amelia


00:05:48.752 --> 00:05:52.610
Amelia, we found William


00:06:35.776 --> 00:06:37.340
Leave him be!


00:06:41.407 --> 00:06:43.596
Stop this, you're killing him!


00:06:45.682 --> 00:06:46.828
More!


00:07:11.644 --> 00:07:13.104
William


00:07:13.729 --> 00:07:15.189
Markus!


00:07:15.919 --> 00:07:19.047
He was not to be harmed!


00:07:19.048 --> 00:07:23.009
Place him in my charge as we agreed
or you will pay for your deceit


00:07:23.218 --> 00:07:26.137
And you will learn your place


00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:28.431
Your sympathy for this beast
is foolish


00:07:28.433 --> 00:07:32.184
Your brother is entirely
beyond control


00:07:32.289 --> 00:07:34.062
It will be done my way


00:07:34.071 --> 00:07:37.262
You know well the consequences
if you murder me or William


00:07:37.294 --> 00:07:44.488
If you so much as speak his name again you
will have chosen that future for him


00:07:52.829 --> 00:07:54.185
What is thy will...


00:07:55.332 --> 00:07:56.374
... my lord


00:07:57.938 --> 00:08:02.943
Imprisonment for all time


00:08:03.152 --> 00:08:05.028
Far from you


00:08:14.517 --> 00:08:18.792
For 6 centuries I was a loyal
soldier of the Vampire clan


00:08:21.086 --> 00:08:22.650
But I was betrayed


00:08:24.214 --> 00:08:26.924
The war was not as it had seemed


00:08:27.759 --> 00:08:33.179
In one night the lies that have
united our kind has been exposed


00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:39.541
Craven our second in command had
formed a secret alliance with Lucian...


00:08:39.543 --> 00:08:42.147
...ruler of the Werewolf clan...


00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:44.337
... to overthrow Viktor, our leader


00:08:45.588 --> 00:08:49.342
But Craven's lust for power and
domination had failed


00:08:50.072 --> 00:08:52.991
Viktor is not the savior
I had lead to believe


00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:58.830
He had betrayed us all


00:09:04.565 --> 00:09:07.171
Soon the hunt will be on
for his killer


00:09:11.238 --> 00:09:15.304
I have but one ally left,
Michael


00:09:16.138 --> 00:09:18.953
The human descendent of Corvinus


00:09:19.475 --> 00:09:23.437
Not a Vampire nor Lycan
but a hybrid


00:09:26.773 --> 00:09:30.423
It's only a matter of time
before we're found


00:09:51.797 --> 00:09:54.300
My only hope now is to
awaken Markus...


00:09:54.925 --> 00:09:59.617
... our last remaining elder
and expose the truth


00:09:59.617 --> 00:10:02.954
before Craven tries to murder
him while still in hibernation


00:10:06.297 --> 00:10:08.584
Craven knows he is no match
for him awake


00:11:21.988 --> 00:11:24.073
This thing has been dead
for weeks


00:11:24.178 --> 00:11:26.784
I thought lycans went back to
their human form when they died


00:11:26.785 --> 00:11:32.300
They do, this one's been given a
serum to stop regression so it can
be studied


00:11:32.415 --> 00:11:33.770
How can you tell?


00:11:40.548 --> 00:11:43.884
- Not quite your department I guess
- I just kill them...


00:11:43.886 --> 00:11:46.804
... don't pay much attention
to their anatomy


00:11:46.908 --> 00:11:49.515
- How long can we stay here?
- Not long


00:11:49.619 --> 00:11:52.851
These safe houses are all linked
together on one mainframe...


00:11:52.853 --> 00:11:55.041
... motion sensors say which
ones are active


00:11:55.041 --> 00:11:57.439
Someone could have picked us
up already


00:12:05.467 --> 00:12:08.074
It's only about an hour to daylight


00:12:08.075 --> 00:12:10.576
Can you even make it back to
the mansion before sunrise?


00:12:10.681 --> 00:12:11.619
Just


00:12:11.723 --> 00:12:13.704
Ok, let's get what we need and go


00:12:13.809 --> 00:12:14.851
No


00:12:15.685 --> 00:12:18.501
I'm going alone


00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:38.937
Open it


00:14:25.185 --> 00:14:31.441
- Markus...
- The blood memories of this wretched creature...


00:14:32.066 --> 00:14:36.237
... has shown me that your
treachery knows no bounds


00:14:38.426 --> 00:14:40.929
My lord, I can explain


00:14:41.554 --> 00:14:47.289
Why should I listen to your lies?
When the journey to the truth...


00:14:51.668 --> 00:14:54.379
... is so much sweeter


00:15:02.095 --> 00:15:04.597
I kept the secrets


00:15:04.702 --> 00:15:08.768
Cleaned up the mess
"You will go before Viktor..."


00:15:09.394 --> 00:15:10.645
"... and tell him exactly what
I tell you to"


00:15:24.095 --> 00:15:26.806
Please ... I can assist you


00:15:28.579 --> 00:15:30.143
Oh you already have


00:15:38.276 --> 00:15:41.404
If I complete my case there's a
chance you'll be granted sanctuary


00:15:41.405 --> 00:15:43.906
Right now you'll be killed on sight


00:15:44.011 --> 00:15:46.304
- Not willing to risk it
- What am I supposed to do sit here and wait?


00:15:46.304 --> 00:15:48.806
Craven may still have his men with him,
you're not going alone


00:15:48.808 --> 00:15:52.247
- You're not as strong as you might think
- What?


00:15:52.249 --> 00:15:53.498
Michael, you're unique


00:15:53.916 --> 00:15:56.628
There has never been a hybrid before


00:15:56.628 --> 00:16:00.067
However ambivalent you are about it,
The truth is your powers may be limitless


00:16:00.068 --> 00:16:03.195
You depend on blood, you need
to feed


00:16:03.822 --> 00:16:07.262
Without it you will be growing
weaker by the second, use the time for that


00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:14.248
Jesus Christ... and what if I don't?
Or if I can't?


00:16:14.249 --> 00:16:15.290
It could be lethal


00:16:15.291 --> 00:16:18.731
If you don't anticipate your cravings,
you will attack humans


00:16:18.732 --> 00:16:23.319
And believe me you don't want
that on your conscience


00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:26.238
There really is no going back Michael


00:16:27.489 --> 00:16:28.949
I'm Sorry


00:16:29.888 --> 00:16:33.745
Look I understand what you did,
I'm grateful


00:16:34.892 --> 00:16:37.603
You saved my life


00:16:38.542 --> 00:16:40.627
I wasn't ready to die


00:16:45.840 --> 00:16:48.343
Everything has changed...


00:16:48.344 --> 00:16:54.494
... I probably needed a minute to think
the process all at once


00:16:54.496 --> 00:16:58.561
Look, go, I'll be here


00:16:58.666 --> 00:17:01.689
Just make sure you come back


00:18:25.206 --> 00:18:26.145
Sir


00:18:26.666 --> 00:18:30.628
Witness has been silenced?


00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:34.382
But otherwise unharmed as ordered


00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:40.012
- Show me what you have
- Yes sir


00:18:45.747 --> 00:18:49.501
2 Death Dealers we killed,
we found no lycan bodies


00:18:49.502 --> 00:18:55.027
Apparently they we using some kind of
new ammunition, some sort of UV round


00:18:55.339 --> 00:18:56.903
Amelia?


00:18:59.093 --> 00:19:00.970
No one survived


00:19:01.074 --> 00:19:06.079
It seems Craven's men may have been present
but did nothing to prevent it


00:19:06.183 --> 00:19:07.956
and Viktor?


00:19:28.288 --> 00:19:35.274
- No trace of Markus amongst the ashes?
- It seems he has destroyed his own coven


00:19:35.586 --> 00:19:38.506
It was never his coven


00:20:02.696 --> 00:20:03.634
"We need to go"


00:20:47.426 --> 00:20:48.886
Give me a moment


00:24:12.310 --> 00:24:13.457
How ya' doing


00:24:35.144 --> 00:24:35.864
Thank you


00:25:44.690 --> 00:25:46.463
"... Michael Corvin ..."


00:28:43.195 --> 00:28:43.716
Michael


00:28:52.996 --> 00:28:55.707
- Here, take it
- No


00:28:55.915 --> 00:28:57.375
Michael you'll die


00:29:25.527 --> 00:29:26.883
Can you move?


00:29:31.887 --> 00:29:32.930
We need to go


00:29:54.096 --> 00:29:57.537
- Markus
- I know what you've done, Selene


00:29:58.371 --> 00:30:01.291
Viktor deserved his fate
Craven was no better


00:30:01.293 --> 00:30:06.608
Craven has already reaped the rewards
of his own misdeeds


00:30:06.921 --> 00:30:10.779
and Viktor, he deserved his fate...


00:30:11.092 --> 00:30:13.594
... many times over


00:30:14.741 --> 00:30:18.495
A terrible business the slaying
of your family


00:30:19.537 --> 00:30:24.751
Yet so much effort was spent to
conceal this from me


00:30:26.106 --> 00:30:28.817
What do you suppose Viktor
had to hide?


00:30:29.964 --> 00:30:33.300
Or perhaps, it is you Selene


00:30:35.594 --> 00:30:41.955
As the last of your wretched family
who has something to hide


00:30:51.964 --> 00:30:52.590
Go!


00:32:37.587 --> 00:32:42.383
Dead or alive, you will give
me what I want


00:33:55.056 --> 00:33:56.829
You okay?


00:34:00.270 --> 00:34:03.085
- He's a hybrid isn't he?
- Yes


00:34:03.710 --> 00:34:06.109
He wanted this
Why?


00:34:07.047 --> 00:34:09.342
I don't know


00:34:09.349 --> 00:34:13.407
But we have another problem


00:34:17.057 --> 00:34:20.080
Turn off up here


00:34:24.355 --> 00:34:25.294
Get down


00:34:26.441 --> 00:34:29.360
Keep your foot on the gas
and stay down!


00:34:44.062 --> 00:34:44.792
Hold on!


00:36:16.025 --> 00:36:17.589
Give me your hand


00:36:18.736 --> 00:36:20.925
Jesus Christ


00:36:21.655 --> 00:36:24.053
- There's really no need
- Be right back


00:36:41.362 --> 00:36:43.238
Let me see


00:36:47.409 --> 00:36:48.348
See...


00:36:48.452 --> 00:36:50.952
...no need


00:40:39.402 --> 00:40:40.758
Area secure sir


00:42:08.029 --> 00:42:10.844
The sun is setting


00:42:11.366 --> 00:42:13.659
What's wrong?


00:42:19.707 --> 00:42:22.939
If supplies were taken used
weapons were left behind


00:42:22.940 --> 00:42:26.171
they couldn't have gone very far


00:42:26.172 --> 00:42:30.134
Remain airborne for the moment
I'm sure they will re-appear


00:42:30.135 --> 00:42:30.759
Yes sir


00:42:35.660 --> 00:42:38.475
I've seen this before when
I was a child


00:42:39.205 --> 00:42:42.541
I've held it when it was
open like this


00:42:42.542 --> 00:42:44.001
How is that possible?


00:42:45.357 --> 00:42:46.712
I don't know


00:42:49.840 --> 00:42:52.447
But I know someone that might


00:42:52.447 --> 00:42:56.722
Andreas Tanis, he was the official
historian of the covens


00:43:00.058 --> 00:43:04.020
He fell from favor after documenting
what Viktor considered malicious lies


00:43:04.021 --> 00:43:06.627
Of course as it turns out he's
been telling the truth


00:43:06.731 --> 00:43:11.006
- What happened to him?
- He was exiled over 300 years ago


00:43:11.007 --> 00:43:14.968
300 years?  What makes you think
we're going to find him now?


00:43:14.969 --> 00:43:17.471
I was the one who exiled him


00:43:55.736 --> 00:44:00.011
- Looks like a monastery
- It used to be, more like a prison now


00:44:00.430 --> 00:44:02.931
Tanis has been hiding there since
Viktor's order


00:44:02.932 --> 00:44:06.059
We're the most people he'd
seen in centuries


00:44:17.424 --> 00:44:19.509
- That's odd
- What?


00:44:19.926 --> 00:44:23.159
I don't remember this
gate being here before


00:44:24.827 --> 00:44:26.599
Take this


00:45:56.790 --> 00:45:57.416
Go back!


00:46:00.335 --> 00:46:00.961
Got you


00:46:04.506 --> 00:46:05.131
Fuck


00:48:39.759 --> 00:48:41.531
I knew it was you Selene


00:48:41.844 --> 00:48:46.015
The stench of Viktor's blood
still lingers in your veins


00:48:46.016 --> 00:48:49.560
Tanis, I see your aim hasn't improved


00:48:51.541 --> 00:48:55.607
You haven't changed
You don't scare me Selene


00:48:56.650 --> 00:48:59.674
Well we're going to have
to work on that


00:49:08.745 --> 00:49:09.788
We need to talk


00:49:14.480 --> 00:49:17.608
Your exile seems a bit more
comfortable than I remember


00:49:17.712 --> 00:49:21.361
- How does a Vampire have Lycan bodyguards?
- A gift


00:49:21.570 --> 00:49:24.593
From a most persuasive client


00:49:24.698 --> 00:49:25.845
Lucian


00:49:27.409 --> 00:49:29.494
Why would Lucian want to protect you?


00:49:30.224 --> 00:49:32.831
Because he was trading with them


00:49:34.395 --> 00:49:39.712
UV rounds, how long have you been in
the business of killing your own kind


00:49:39.714 --> 00:49:41.485
I've done what's necessary to survive


00:49:42.319 --> 00:49:46.489
My decision was easy once your
precious Viktor betrayed me


00:49:46.907 --> 00:49:49.513
Betrayal was something he did
very well


00:49:51.286 --> 00:49:53.580
Viktor's dead
I killed him


00:49:54.205 --> 00:49:56.603
You?  Killed Viktor?


00:50:01.400 --> 00:50:03.172
No I think not


00:50:05.779 --> 00:50:08.803
Oh unless you've learned the truth


00:50:12.973 --> 00:50:15.476
So your eyes are finally open


00:50:16.623 --> 00:50:21.419
Ain't it interesting that the truth
is even harder to absorb than lies


00:50:21.420 --> 00:50:28.092
You know I tried to stop him of course,
a travesty committing such a horrible crime


00:50:28.093 --> 00:50:31.637
And then turning you
That was too much to take


00:50:31.950 --> 00:50:35.912
My protest as to why he put me here


00:50:35.913 --> 00:50:39.978
Careful with that dear...
... makes a terrible bang


00:50:40.500 --> 00:50:43.211
Open the blades and they're active


00:50:43.523 --> 00:50:44.775
Good to know


00:50:48.945 --> 00:50:54.159
Viktor put you here for a reason but
I doubt its because you had moral qualms


00:50:54.160 --> 00:50:56.869
- What do you know?
- Very little of anything...


00:50:56.871 --> 00:50:57.912
... I'm afraid


00:51:04.377 --> 00:51:09.173
Oh, then perhaps I may be mistaken,
then there's no use for you at all


00:51:09.174 --> 00:51:11.571
Markus was after this
Why?


00:51:55.884 --> 00:51:58.178
Some history is based on truth...


00:51:59.012 --> 00:52:00.264
... and others on deception


00:52:02.662 --> 00:52:06.311
Viktor was not the first of our
kind as you were led to believe


00:52:06.312 --> 00:52:10.482
He was once human,
ruler of his lands


00:52:12.359 --> 00:52:17.051
Markus,
he's the one


00:52:18.406 --> 00:52:22.889
The source,
the first true Vampire


00:52:23.619 --> 00:52:26.017
So the legend is true


00:52:26.747 --> 00:52:29.145
Toward the end of his ruthless life


00:52:30.814 --> 00:52:35.297
his next breath meant more to
Viktor than silver or gold


00:52:35.298 --> 00:52:40.093
Markus came with an offer,
a reprieve ...


00:52:40.823 --> 00:52:43.951
... from sickness and death
Immortality


00:52:44.890 --> 00:52:49.477
In return, Viktor was to use his
army turned immortal to protect him


00:52:49.478 --> 00:52:50.624
To do what?


00:52:51.146 --> 00:52:53.440
To defeat the very first werewolves


00:52:53.857 --> 00:52:59.279
A dangerous and very infectious breed
Created by Markus's own flesh and blood


00:53:01.364 --> 00:53:03.241
His twin brother William


00:53:05.117 --> 00:53:09.705
But these weren't the Lycans we know
disgusting as your brethren may be ...


00:53:09.706 --> 00:53:14.189
... they at least are evolved
No these were raging monsters


00:53:14.198 --> 00:53:17.421
Never able to take human form again


00:53:17.430 --> 00:53:20.340
It's only the later generations that
learned to channel their rage


00:53:20.550 --> 00:53:24.720
And William's appetite for destruction
and rampage was insatiable


00:53:25.971 --> 00:53:30.558
He had to be stopped,
So once Viktor's army was turned ...


00:53:30.560 --> 00:53:35.250
... the legions of Vampires under his control
tracked down and destroyed the animals


00:53:36.085 --> 00:53:39.734
Then captured William and locked him away


00:53:39.942 --> 00:53:42.549
Viktor's prisoner for all time


00:53:44.947 --> 00:53:46.198
Why let him live?


00:53:46.200 --> 00:53:49.326
For the same reason why Viktor
never conspired against Markus


00:53:49.328 --> 00:53:50.578
Fear


00:53:51.099 --> 00:53:57.981
He was warned if Markus should ever be killed,
all those in his blood line would follow him to the grave


00:53:58.085 --> 00:54:02.777
So in Viktor's mind, William's death would
be the end for all Lycans ...


00:54:02.778 --> 00:54:04.132
... his slaves


00:54:05.696 --> 00:54:07.052
Yes


00:54:08.407 --> 00:54:13.620
Yes a clever deception
but one Viktor was hardly willing to put to the test


00:54:15.080 --> 00:54:18.730
So Markus was protected,
at all costs


00:54:23.005 --> 00:54:26.550
Ah yes, here we are


00:54:29.678 --> 00:54:32.284
- Vampires?
- Mortals


00:54:33.223 --> 00:54:35.621
Men loyal to Alexander Corvinus


00:54:38.228 --> 00:54:40.313
The father of us all


00:54:47.403 --> 00:54:48.446
What's this?


00:54:52.721 --> 00:54:56.891
You should know,
It's William's prison


00:54:59.394 --> 00:55:03.252
The prison your father was
commissioned to build


00:55:08.465 --> 00:55:11.906
"So you've been the one keeping
a watch over this for me have you"


00:55:19.413 --> 00:55:20.456
What is it?


00:55:21.394 --> 00:55:22.749
what's wrong?


00:55:23.688 --> 00:55:27.650
She now understands why her
family was killed


00:55:29.840 --> 00:55:32.133
But that was many years later


00:55:33.280 --> 00:55:37.242
The winter of Lucian's escape,
your father knew too much


00:55:37.555 --> 00:55:39.849
or too much for Viktor to risk


00:55:39.850 --> 00:55:45.271
Especially when Lucian had the
key to William's cell


00:55:46.939 --> 00:55:49.859
And I'm the map


00:55:50.067 --> 00:55:51.944
Yes


00:55:52.257 --> 00:55:56.740
The only one still living who
has seen its location


00:55:57.470 --> 00:56:01.120
Oh Viktor realized you'd be too
young to remember explicitly ...


00:56:01.123 --> 00:56:07.897
... but Markus knows that the memory and
therefore the exact location of Williams prison ...


00:56:08.105 --> 00:56:10.191
... is hidden away in your blood


00:56:11.442 --> 00:56:15.404
Why is Markus looking for him now?
After all this time?


00:56:15.925 --> 00:56:17.906
That I cannot answer


00:56:28.750 --> 00:56:34.172
But I do know someone who could stop him,
perhaps I could arrange a meeting


00:56:34.381 --> 00:56:38.864
In exchange for your discretion
of course


00:56:40.220 --> 00:56:41.158
Of course


00:57:36.628 --> 00:57:39.443
Tanis, you seem anxious


00:57:40.277 --> 00:57:42.988
Why do you flee the very sight of me?


00:57:48.201 --> 00:57:51.017
Please, sit


00:57:53.206 --> 00:57:57.168
There's no need for this to
be unpleasant


00:57:57.168 --> 00:58:00.088
I always rather enjoyed
your company


00:58:05.718 --> 00:58:07.178
Now you're being rude


00:58:09.055 --> 00:58:10.723
Sorry


00:58:18.751 --> 00:58:23.339
Viktor struck 2 keys,
what do you know of them?


00:58:24.799 --> 00:58:30.429
Keys?
I don't know of any keys


00:58:45.746 --> 00:58:49.197
Oh yes, those keys


00:58:52.013 --> 00:58:57.122
Yes?
One was kept in plain sight...


00:58:57.226 --> 00:59:00.250
... draped around his daughters neck


00:59:00.354 --> 00:59:03.378
- Right there for you to see
- And the other?


00:59:05.463 --> 00:59:08.382
- Kept with Viktor at all times
- Where?


00:59:09.529 --> 00:59:10.363
Within him


00:59:12.762 --> 00:59:14.743
Beneath the flesh


00:59:42.790 --> 00:59:44.980
... perhaps I could arrange a meeting


00:59:44.981 --> 00:59:48.212
... go to pier 17, ask for Lorenz Macaro


01:00:12.298 --> 01:00:19.388
- How do you know he's not just setting us up?
- He's not brave enough to set me up


01:00:43.369 --> 01:00:44.203
You can go


01:00:54.734 --> 01:00:56.507
You're familiar with this then?


01:01:04.431 --> 01:01:05.578
Intimately


01:01:12.877 --> 01:01:14.754
You are Alexander Corvinus


01:01:20.175 --> 01:01:24.555
There was a time when I
was known by that name


01:01:26.014 --> 01:01:29.872
By any name I am still
your forefather


01:01:35.398 --> 01:01:38.631
How have you stayed hidden
all these years?


01:01:38.839 --> 01:01:44.470
For centuries I have stood by and watched
the havoc my sons have brought upon each other ...


01:01:44.471 --> 01:01:46.034
... and upon humanity


01:01:47.806 --> 01:01:53.332
Not the legacy I prayed for the morning
I watched them enter this world


01:01:53.333 --> 01:01:58.441
And a tiresome duty!
Keeping the war contained, cleaning up the mess


01:01:59.693 --> 01:02:03.238
Hiding my family's unfortunate history


01:02:03.550 --> 01:02:06.470
- Couldn't you have stopped it?
- Yes ...


01:02:06.783 --> 01:02:11.892
- Could you kill your own sons?
- You know what Markus will do?


01:02:11.893 --> 01:02:14.811
If he finds me, he finds William's prison


01:02:15.020 --> 01:02:18.565
You need to help us stop him


01:02:18.566 --> 01:02:22.527
You are asking me to help you
kill my son?


01:02:22.528 --> 01:02:26.281
You?  A Death Dealer?


01:02:26.698 --> 01:02:30.660
How many innocents did killed in the
6 century quest to avenge your family?


01:02:30.661 --> 01:02:35.456
Spare me your self-righteous declarations,
you are no different from Markus


01:02:35.457 --> 01:02:37.958
And even less noble than William


01:02:38.480 --> 01:02:41.608
At least he cannot control
his savagery


01:02:41.609 --> 01:02:44.840
Anything I've done can be
laid at your feet


01:02:44.841 --> 01:02:48.072
Hundreds of thousands have died
because of your inability to accept ...


01:02:48.073 --> 01:02:50.053
... that you sons are monsters!


01:02:50.158 --> 01:02:52.556
That they create monsters!


01:02:52.557 --> 01:02:53.859
You could have stopped all of this


01:02:53.860 --> 01:02:59.646
Don't come groveling to me simply
because you are weaker than your adversary


01:02:59.647 --> 01:03:02.461
You know the devastation William
caused before he was captured


01:03:02.462 --> 01:03:04.546
He cannot be set free


01:03:51.883 --> 01:03:53.760
No, wait!


01:03:53.969 --> 01:03:56.575
You're no match for him


01:04:18.367 --> 01:04:20.348
Soon, brother


01:05:11.960 --> 01:05:15.610
They're gone...
... there, there, my child, you are safe now


01:06:04.823 --> 01:06:06.909
No, Michael


01:06:08.056 --> 01:06:09.828
Look at me!


01:06:11.184 --> 01:06:12.643
Michael!


01:07:50.758 --> 01:07:52.427
Hello father


01:07:53.365 --> 01:07:55.972
You are unwelcomed in my presence


01:07:57.223 --> 01:08:02.019
Ah, the predictable heart,
that never thaws


01:08:03.270 --> 01:08:06.503
Pity it beats within such a fool


01:08:07.337 --> 01:08:09.422
The eldest of the immortals...


01:08:09.839 --> 01:08:14.114
... yet you have made no attempt
to seize your destiny


01:08:14.115 --> 01:08:17.763
We are oddities of nature
you and I


01:08:17.869 --> 01:08:19.327
Nothing more


01:08:19.432 --> 01:08:22.038
This is a world for humanity


01:08:22.039 --> 01:08:26.730
And that petty sentiment explains
why you rejected your sons?


01:08:26.731 --> 01:08:32.569
Why you stood by for half a millennium
as William suffered alone in darkness?


01:08:33.195 --> 01:08:38.721
No father, I have no sympathy
for your petty sentiment


01:08:41.015 --> 01:08:44.039
Viktor's key ... where is it?


01:08:44.351 --> 01:08:48.522
Whatever plan you have for William
is futile, you cannot control him


01:08:48.523 --> 01:08:50.920
Oh I am stronger now


01:08:51.338 --> 01:08:54.048
And our bond is greater than
you've ever wanted to acknowledge


01:08:54.049 --> 01:08:58.792
You're wrong, soon you'll be drowning
in Lycans just like before


01:08:58.814 --> 01:09:02.494
Not Lycans father or vampires


01:09:03.015 --> 01:09:07.186
A new race, created in the image
of their maker


01:09:08.750 --> 01:09:09.688
Their new god


01:09:13.233 --> 01:09:14.380
Me


01:09:27.205 --> 01:09:29.499
And a true god ...


01:09:34.295 --> 01:09:36.485
... has no father


01:10:12.144 --> 01:10:14.229
You will fail


01:10:49.680 --> 01:10:51.557
- Get the kit!
- No!


01:10:58.647 --> 01:11:01.462
Please sir, let us help you


01:11:02.713 --> 01:11:05.528
The time has come my friend


01:11:06.258 --> 01:11:08.135
Find the girl ...


01:11:09.073 --> 01:11:10.637
... bring her to me


01:11:16.789 --> 01:11:18.040
No, wait, wait


01:11:21.898 --> 01:11:26.590
If you want Markus, you will
need Alexander's help


01:11:31.282 --> 01:11:32.951
Don't leave him here


01:11:53.283 --> 01:11:55.472
- Did he get the pendant?
- Yes


01:11:57.870 --> 01:12:00.164
He's too powerful for you alone


01:12:00.894 --> 01:12:05.273
You're the only one older than
he is, the only one stronger


01:12:05.482 --> 01:12:07.254
You could have killed him yourself


01:12:09.131 --> 01:12:12.363
No matter what he's become ...


01:12:13.302 --> 01:12:16.534
... he is my son


01:12:21.226 --> 01:12:22.790
You are the last hope left


01:12:24.875 --> 01:12:27.691
There is only one way to
defeat him


01:12:35.511 --> 01:12:41.767
Quickly now, before there is no
more legacy left in my veins


01:12:50.316 --> 01:12:51.985
What will I become?


01:12:54.174 --> 01:12:56.989
The future


01:13:38.800 --> 01:13:40.364
Go now


01:17:28.291 --> 01:17:29.334
We're getting close


01:18:24.908 --> 01:18:26.785
Head back around towards the river


01:18:38.984 --> 01:18:41.174
I don't see a way inside


01:18:43.572 --> 01:18:46.387
There used to be a river
entrance just there


01:18:46.595 --> 01:18:48.472
It must be submerged now


01:18:48.473 --> 01:18:50.975
Looks like we're getting wet


01:19:25.904 --> 01:19:26.530
Closer!


01:19:33.098 --> 01:19:34.662
Selene!


01:20:47.858 --> 01:20:48.890
William ...


01:21:04.645 --> 01:21:05.062
Wait


01:21:11.213 --> 01:21:13.090
No William stop!


01:21:13.194 --> 01:21:14.758
Be still brother


01:21:15.280 --> 01:21:16.531
It's me


01:21:20.076 --> 01:21:22.995
I'd no sooner harm you than myself


01:21:55.527 --> 01:21:56.361
Which way?


01:22:24.409 --> 01:22:25.347
Is this it?


01:22:30.560 --> 01:22:32.020
He's already here


01:23:06.324 --> 01:23:09.347
- What is it?
- Nothing


01:23:10.077 --> 01:23:11.433
Let's go


01:23:22.694 --> 01:23:24.362
We're too late


01:24:03.462 --> 01:24:04.296
Impressive


01:25:14.155 --> 01:25:15.719
Michael you're unique


01:25:17.908 --> 01:25:20.828
There's never been a hybrid before


01:25:21.401 --> 01:25:23.956
You powers could be limitless


01:25:40.743 --> 01:25:41.681
Hold it!


01:25:46.999 --> 01:25:50.127
- Where is he?
- He went right through there


01:25:51.482 --> 01:25:54.297
All we have is UV rounds,
it won't take him down


01:25:54.299 --> 01:25:56.466
No, but it'll slow him down


01:26:42.990 --> 01:26:44.345
Let's go


01:26:44.762 --> 01:26:45.492
You alright?


01:29:58.281 --> 01:30:03.495
No these are not the lycans you know ...
... raging monsters ... unable to take human form ever again


01:30:53.021 --> 01:30:54.064
What are you waiting for?


01:30:54.065 --> 01:30:55.524
Shoot 'em!


01:30:55.525 --> 01:30:57.609
I can't, not without taking
her out!


01:30:57.714 --> 01:30:59.694
I can't get a shot!


01:31:50.681 --> 01:31:52.349
Michael


01:32:28.425 --> 01:32:29.051
Take him down!


01:34:48.664 --> 01:34:49.289
William!


01:35:00.759 --> 01:35:05.451
I knew Viktor made a mistake
by keeping you as a pet


01:35:05.452 --> 01:35:09.517
He should have killed you
with the rest of you family


01:37:56.969 --> 01:37:59.263
An unknown chapter lies ahead


01:38:00.202 --> 01:38:03.955
The lines that have divided the
clans has now been blurred


01:38:03.956 --> 01:38:07.083
Chaos and infighting are inevitable


01:38:07.084 --> 01:38:10.941
All that is certain is that
darkness is still ahead


01:38:10.942 --> 01:38:14.173
But for now for the first time


01:38:14.800 --> 01:38:18.344
I look into the light with new hope

